 style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;line-height:1.5;direction:ltr;"><br/></p><p style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;line-height:0;text-align:center;direction:ltr;"><br/></p><p class="mcePastedContent" style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;line-height:1.5;direction:ltr;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">We specialize in </span><strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">Industrial Design, Prototyping, and Design-for-Manufacturing, Delivering Scalable, Cost-efficient products ready for production.</span></strong></p><p class="mcePastedContent" style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;line-height:1.5;direction:ltr;"><br/></p><p style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;line-height:0;text-align:center;direction:ltr;"><br/></p><p class="mcePastedContent" style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;line-height:1.5;direction:ltr;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">One of our recent projects, the </span><strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">Havells Gatik Neo fan</span></strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">, has received excellent customer response on </span><strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">Amazon</span></strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">, with over </span><strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">1000 reviews.</span></strong></p><p class="mcePastedContent" style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;line-height:1.5;direction:ltr;"><br/></p><p style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;line-height:0;text-align:center;direction:ltr;"><br/></p><p class="mcePastedContent" style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;line-height:1.5;direction:ltr;"><strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">Here’s a quick look at what we’ve built - </span></strong><a href="https://www.amazon.in/Havells-Gatik-400mm-Pedestal-White/dp/B09VL9JJC4/ref=asc_df_B09VL9JJC4?mcid=d8a2dd4419e8306996b6b95f3575abc2&amp;tag=googleshopdes-21&amp;linkCode=df0&amp;hvadid=709881799918&amp;hvpos=&amp;hvnetw=g&amp;hvrand=10333265392427306387&amp;hvpone=&amp;hvptwo=&amp;hvqmt=&amp;hvdev=c&amp;hvdvcmdl=&amp;hvlocint=&amp;hvlocphy=9062220&amp;hvtargid=pla-1730188247204&amp;psc=1&amp;hvocijid=10333265392427306387-B09VL9JJC4-&amp;hvexpln=0&amp;gad_source=1" target="_blank" style="text-size-adjust:100%;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);direction:ltr;"><strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;">Click Here</span></strong></a></p><p class="mcePastedContent" style="text-size-adjust:100%;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(65, 55, 54);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-s