1333ee2f-8279-4394-92d9-c0546f68c80a	test	mnk	Rupali Sirsath — IUOVA Design Consultancy	New Leads	Custom	\N	\N	Hi {{first_name}},\r\n\r\nI hope this finds you well. I'm Rupali from IUOVA Design Consultancy — a Mumbai-based industrial design and engineering studio working with India's top OEMs including Bajaj Electricals, Havells, and Crompton.\r\n\r\nI came across {{company}}'s work in product innovation and wanted to reach out. We've been helping companies like yours compress design cycles, reduce cost through DFM, and build proprietary IP through structured design methodology.\r\n\r\nWe call our approach THE FORGE™ — a 6-stage design-to-market system trusted by 20+ Indian and international OEMs.\r\n\r\nWould you be open to a 20-minute call to explore fit?\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nRupali Sirsath\r\n\r\nBusiness Development | IUOVA Design Consultancy	\N	sent	2026-08-18 16:57:42.998	2026-08-18 16:57:49.563	Hi {{first_name}},\r\n\r\nI hope this finds you well. I'm Rupali from IUOVA Design Consultancy — a Mumbai-based industrial design and engineering studio working with India's top OEMs including Bajaj Electricals, Havells, and Crompton.\r\n\r\nI came across {{company}}'s work in product innovation and wanted to reach out. We've been helping companies like yours compress design cycles, reduce cost through DFM, and build proprietary IP through structured design methodology.\r\n\r\nWe call our approach THE FORGE™ — a 6-stage design-to-market system trusted by 20+ Indian and international OEMs.\r\n\r\nWould you be open to a 20-minute call to explore fit?\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nRupali Sirsath\r\n\r\nBusiness Development | IUOVA Design Consultancy	\N	2	2026-08-18 16:57:49.563+00	\N	\N
be4a3099-b332-41f5-a8a2-c91d40c59803	test	Partnership Opportunity: Design Intelligence for {{company}}	Rupali Sirsath — IUOVA Design Consultancy	Existing Clients Only	Product Launch	2026-08-12	11:00:00	Dear {{first_name}},\r\n\r\nWhat if {{company}} had a dedicated design and engineering intelligence team — without the overhead of building one in-house?\r\n\r\nThe Innovation Pipeline Retainer from IUOVA is a capability subscription designed for OEM innovation leads who need consistent output: product concepts, DFM-ready CAD, FEA analysis, embedded design, and packaging — all under one structured engagement.\r\n\r\nWhat's included monthly:\r\n\r\n• 2 concept sprints per month\r\n• Dedicated design + engineering pod (8–10 specialists)\r\n• Monthly strategy review with IUOVA leadership\r\n• IP documentation & handoff protocols\r\n\r\nInvestment: ₹6–8L/month\r\n\r\nI'd love to walk you through a tailored proposal for {{company}}.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nRupali Sirsath | IUOVA	\N	sent	2026-08-12 05:13:09.454	2026-08-12 05:30:19.518	Dear {{first_name}},\r\n\r\nWhat if {{company}} had a dedicated design and engineering intelligence team — without the overhead of building one in-house?\r\n\r\nThe Innovation Pipeline Retainer from IUOVA is a capability subscription designed for OEM innovation leads who need consistent output: product concepts, DFM-ready CAD, FEA analysis, embedded design, and packaging — all under one structured engagement.\r\n\r\nWhat's included monthly:\r\n\r\n• 2 concept sprints per month\r\n• Dedicated design + engineering pod (8–10 specialists)\r\n• Monthly strategy review with IUOVA leadership\r\n• IP documentation & handoff protocols\r\n\r\nInvestment: ₹6–8L/month\r\n\r\nI'd love to walk you through a tailored proposal for {{company}}.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nRupali Sirsath | IUOVA	\N	6	2026-08-12 05:30:19.518+00	\N	\N
