rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:"Gilda Display", serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);}</style><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/><title>New Template</title></head><body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#fafafa;color:#ededed;"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="50%" style="background-color:#fafafa;width:50%;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;background-color:#fafafa;"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100px" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;width:100px;"><tbody><tr></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><img src="https://novreeapdwjnpzflyiey.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/email%20template/images/1787210527702-0db3016a-7bf5-4183-8649-401c4cf41ba1.png" style="display:block;width:208px;height:70px;margin:0 auto 16px;border:0;"/><img src="https://novreeapdwjnpzflyiey.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/email%20template/images/1787204910703-b0a6d3b9-f48a-4f60-b747-15d84d5c54fc.png" style="display:block;maxWidth:100%;height:303px;margin:0 auto 16px;border:0;width:601px;"/><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;margin:0 0 16px;background-color:#F8FAFC;border-radius:8px;"><tbody><tr></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;width:433px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;"><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">               For a long time, hardware companies competed by building better products-Better specifications, Better performance, More features, Lower cost.</span><br id="ipjf2" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="ipwlg" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">That model worked when technology advantages lasted for years. Today, they often last for months!</span><br id="iwsxg" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="i7ni4" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">A feature introduced by one company quickly becomes standard across the category. Global supply chains have matured, manufacturing access has expanded, and competitors can replicate technical improvements faster than ever before.</span><br id="iqrkb" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="i3syp" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">According to McKinsey, product life cycles across industries have reduced by nearly 4x over the past 50 years.</span><br id="iznmh" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="i6yjm" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">This is fundamentally changing differentiation in hardware. Because when technical advantages become easier to replicate, products slowly begin competing on familiarity instead of originality. And eventually, categories start looking interchangeable.</span><br id="ietml" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="ifz3u" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">We see this across appliances, consumer electronics, wearables, IoT products and lifestyle hardware. Specifications improve every year. But the emotional distance between products keeps shrinking.</span><br id="ifieq" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="ivy4p" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">This is where commoditization begins. Not because products are poorly engineered. But because customers stop experiencing meaningful distinction between one product and another.</span><br id="ivhlh" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="icr6v" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Research in consumer behavior consistently shows that customers form first impressions within seconds, heavily influencing perceived quality, trust and purchase intent long before specifications are evaluated.</span><br id="iar0j" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="i9yrd" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">That means customers are evaluating far more than features-</span><br id="iipdk" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">How refined the proportions feel.</span><br id="i4xpm" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">How precise the fit and finish looks.</span><br id="ie45f" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">How confidently materials are handled.</span><br id="igwl7" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">How recognizable the design language becomes.</span><br id="ip46r" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">How consistent the product feels across a portfolio.</span><br id="i2aig" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="icotq" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">This is one of the reasons brands like Apple, Dyson, Braun and Nothing continue creating preference even in crowded markets. Their advantage is not only technology. It is recognition.</span><br id="ill5d" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br id="idkgl" draggable="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;, serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">At </span></p><p style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;margin:0 0 12px;text-align:left;"></p><p sty