df396c97-0a93-4908-94eb-22e37c272a5d	Cold Outreach	Cold Outreach	First touch to new prospect	Partnership Opportunity: Design Intelligence for {{company}}	Hi {{first_name}},\r\n\r\nI hope this finds you well. I'm Rupali from <strong>IUOVA Design Consultancy</strong> — a Mumbai-based industrial design and engineering studio working with India's top OEMs including Bajaj Electricals, Havells, and Crompton.\r\n\r\nI came across {{company}}'s work in product innovation and wanted to reach out. We've been helping companies like yours compress design cycles, reduce cost through DFM, and build proprietary IP through structured design methodology.\r\n\r\nWe call our approach <strong>THE FORGE™</strong> — a 6-stage design-to-market system trusted by 20+ Indian and international OEMs.\r\n\r\nWould you be open to a 20-minute call to explore fit?\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nRupali Sirsath\r\n\r\nBusiness Development | IUOVA Design Consultancy	t	2026-08-06 05:06:26.973097+00	2026-08-06 05:06:26.973097+00	database	\N	\N
949acc36-7725-4525-b37a-cf59a142d865	The Design Brief	Newsletter	IUOVA newsletter format	The Design Brief | Design Intelligence from IUOVA	<strong>THE DESIGN BRIEF</strong>\r\n\r\n<em>Design intelligence from IUOVA</em>\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n<strong>01 / Feature Story</strong>\r\n\r\n[Your feature headline here — insight, case study, or innovation story]\r\n\r\n<strong>02 / From Our Studio</strong>\r\n\r\nA behind-the-scenes look at what IUOVA is currently building.\r\n\r\n<strong>03 / Signal Watch</strong>\r\n\r\n3 trends worth watching in product design, manufacturing, or consumer behaviour.\r\n\r\n<strong>04 / Resource Drop</strong>\r\n\r\nA tool, template, or framework we're using right now.\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThanks for reading The Design Brief. If this resonated, forward it to a colleague in product or design.\r\n\r\nRupali & the IUOVA team	t	2026-08-06 05:26:47.345899+00	2026-08-06 05:26:47.345899+00	database	\N	\N
6d1073f3-ac33-42d7-b1e3-c9c0ec0389e1	Retainer Check-in	Retainer Check-in	Monthly client relationship email	Monthly Retainer Check-in | {{company}} | {{month}}	Hi {{first_name}},\r\n\r\nAs we close out {{month}}, I wanted to send a quick note from the IUOVA team on where things stand.\r\n\r\n<strong>This month's highlights for {{company}}:</strong>\r\n\r\n[Summary of deliverables, milestones, or decisions from the past month]\r\n\r\n<strong>Next 30 days:</strong>\r\n\r\n[Preview of upcoming work and decisions needed]\r\n\r\n<strong>Your input needed on:</strong>\r\n\r\n[Any approvals, reviews, or information required from your side]\r\n\r\nAs always, if there's anything I can help clarify or accelerate, just reply to this email.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nRupali Sirsath\r\n\r\nBusiness Development & Client Relations | IUOVA	t	2026-08-06 05:31:01.481422+00	2026-08-06 05:31:01.481422+00	database	\N	\N
7a1f81ce-d06a-49fe-b996-f728022aef1d	Discovery Sprint	Discovery Sprint	3-day sprint pitch	3-Day Discovery Sprint for {{company}}	Hi {{first_name}},\n\nProduct innovation at {{company}} doesn't have to take months. Our <strong>Discovery Sprint</strong> — a focused 3-day engagement — surfaces hidden product opportunities, maps engineering risk, and produces a decision-ready innovation brief.\n\n<strong>What you get:</strong>\n\n• Market gap analysis & competitor audit\n• 3 concept directions with DFM feasibility\n• Engineering risk matrix\n• Go/No-Go recommendation\n\n<strong>Investment: ₹2.4–3L</strong> (or $6–8K for international engagements)\n\nInterested? I can send a detailed brief and arrange a call this week.\n\nBest,\n\nRupali Sirsath | IUOVA Design Consultancy	t	2026-08-06 05:24:48.10837+00	2026-08-06 05:24:48.10837+00	database	\N	\N
8c951ed1-787f-441c-a46d-3363fcd2ec07	Innovation Retainer	Innovation Retainer	₹6–8L/month subscription pitch	Build a Dedicated Innovation Team for {{company}}	Dear {{first_name}},\r\n\r\nWhat if {{company}} had a dedicated design and engineering intelligence team — without the overhead of building one in-house?\r\n\r\nThe <strong>Innovation Pipeline Retainer</strong> from IUOVA is a capability subscription designed for OEM innovation leads who need consistent output: product concepts, DFM-ready CAD, FEA analysis, embedded design, and packaging — all under one structured engagement.\r\n\r\n<strong>What's included monthly:</strong>\r\n\r\n• 2 concept sprints per month\r\n• Dedicated design + engineering pod (8–10 specialists)\r\n• Monthly strategy review with IUOVA leadership\r\n• IP documentation & handoff protocols\r\n\r\n<strong>Investment: ₹6–8L/month</strong>\r\n\r\nI'd love to walk you through a tailored proposal for {{company}}.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nRupali Sirsath | IUOVA	t	2026-08-06 05:23:05.511903+00	2026-08-06 05:23:05.511903+00	database	\N	\N
