dyTable" role="presentation" style="background-color:rgb(235,235,235)">\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<td class="m_3650911951961197522bodyCell" align="center" valign="top">\r\n<table id="m_3650911951961197522root" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color:transparent" valign="top" align="center"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width:660px" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color:#ffffff" valign="top"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="background-position:center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover" valign="top"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0" valign="top" class="m_3650911951961197522mceColumn" id="m_3650911951961197522mceColumnId--9" colspan="12" width="100%"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color:transparent;padding-top:21px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-right:0;padding-left:0;border:0;border-radius:0" valign="top" align="center" id="m_3650911951961197522b48"><div></div><a href="https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide11/1769683496792_5fqvbh.png" style="display:block" target="_blank"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="46%" style="border-collapse:separate;margin:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:46%;width:46%;height:auto" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="border:0;border-radius:0;margin:0" valign="top"><img alt="" src="https://dim.mcusercontent.com/cs/dd402479fe7ccc7f2368df88d/images/bd92a65e-d695-3e45-ff13-1db600fa2d42.png?dpr=2&amp;rect=0%2C2304%2C8592%2C3189&amp;w=660&amp;h=245" width="303.6" height="auto" style="display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:0" class="m_3650911951961197522mceImage"></td></tr></tbody></table></a><div></div><div>\r\n\r\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:transparent;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-left:14px;border:0;border-radius:0" valign="top" align="center" id="m_3650911951961197522b49"><div></div><a href="https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide11/1769683496792_5fqvbh.png" style="display:block" target="_blank"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="97%" style="border-collapse:separate;margin:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:97%;width:97%;height:auto" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="border:0;border-radius:0;margin:0" valign="top"><img alt="" src="https://mcusercontent.com/dd402479fe7ccc7f2368df88d/images/cb81ce7c-f511-f4fe-b1f4-61d40d079f8d.png" width="603.34" height="auto" style="display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:0" class="m_3650911951961197522mceImage"></td></tr></tbody></table></a><div></div><div>\r\n\r\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0" valign="top" id="m_3650911951961197522gutterContainerId-7"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:separate" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0;border:0;border-radius:0" valign="top" id="m_3650911951961197522b7"><table width="100%" style="border:0;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0;border-collapse:separate"><tbody><tr><td style="padding-left:90px;padding-right:90px;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:0" class="m_3650911951961197522mceTextBlockContainer"><div class="m_3650911951961197522mceText" id="m_3650911951961197522d7" style="width:100%"><p style="line-height:0"><br></p><p style="line-height:0"><br></p><p style="line-height:0"><br></p><p style="line-height:0"><br></p><p style="line-height:0"><br></p><p class="m_3650911951961197522mcePastedContent"><br></p><p class="m_3650911951961197522mcePastedContent"><span style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9)"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:&#39;Gilda Display&#39;,serif"><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255)">For a long time, hardware companies competed by building better products- <br>Better specifications, Better performance, More features, Lower cost.<br><br>That model worked when technology advantages lasted for years. Today, they often last for months!<br><br>A feature introduced by one company quickly becomes standard across the category. Global supply chains have matured, manufacturing access has expanded, and competitors can replicate technical improvements faster than ever before.<br><br>According to McKinsey, product life cycles across industries have reduced by nearly 4x over the past 50 years.<br><br>This is fundamentally changing differentiation in hardware. Because when technical advantages become easier to replicate, products slowly begin competing on familiarity instead of originality. And eventually, categories start looking interchangeable.<br><br>We see this across appliances, consumer electronics, wearables, IoT products and lifestyle hardware. Specifications improve every year. But the emotional distance between products keeps shrinking.<br><br>This is where commoditization begins. Not because products are poorly engineered. But because customers stop experiencing meaningful distinction between one product and another.<br><br>Research in consumer behavior consistently shows that customers form first impressions within seconds, heavily influencing perceived quality, trust and purchase intent long before specifications are evaluated.<br><br>That means customers are evaluating far more than features- <br>How refined the proportions feel.<br>How precise the fit and finish looks.<br>How confidently materials are handled.<br>How recognizable the design language becomes.<br>How consistent the product feels across a portfolio.<br><br>This is one of the reasons brands like Apple, Dyson, Braun and Nothing continue creating preference even in crowded markets. Their advantage is not only technology. It is recognition.<br><br>At </span></span></span></span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/iuovadesigncompany/" style="box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:14px;vertical-align:baseline;background:none 0% 0%/auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:600;border-color:rgb(10,102,194);border-style:none;border-width:0px;color:rgb(10,102,194);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,&quot;Fira Sans&quot;,Ubuntu,Oxygen,&quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;,Cantarell,&quot;Droid Sans&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:inherit!important;word-break:normal;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal" target="_blank"><strong><span style="color:rgb(10,102,194)"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:&#39;Gilda Display&#39;,serif"><span style="background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)">Iuova Design Company</span></span></span></span></strong></a><span style="color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9)"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:&#39;Gilda Display&#39;,serif"><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255)">, one question we often discuss during product development is- <br>“Will this product still feel distinctive after the next five competitors enter the category?”<br><br>Because long-term brand value is rarely built through specifications alone. <br>It is built through memorability, consistency and emotional familiarity over time!</span></span><span style="font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,&quot;Fira Sans&quot;,Ubuntu,Oxygen,&quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;,Cantarell,&quot;Droid Sans&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Helv"><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255)"><br><br></span></span></span></span><strong><span style="font-family:&#39;Gilda Display&#39;,serif"><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255)">You may explore our capabilities and selected projects in our company catalogue.</span></span></strong></p><ul style="margin-bottom:0px;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)"><li style="margin-left:15px;text-align:left"><p style="margin:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;letter-spacing:0px;direction:ltr"><strong><span style="color:rgb(34,34,34)"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;,serif"><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255)">Catalogue - </span></span></span></span></strong><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SzyySBv-wzbo3k4hqRmFfeptwgKW_oHw/view?usp=drive_linkhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1q7u7Qr7aH1JoP8D5k8rIeFSJrgUWv7tf?usp=drive_link" style="color:rgb(17,85,204);word-break:break-word;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;direction:ltr;font-family:verdana,sans-serif" target="_blank"><strong><span style="color:rgb(17,85,204)"><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:&quot;Gilda Display&quot;,serif"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255)">Iuova Design Company Catalogue 2026</span></span></sp